  "details": "The newly-introduced ability to create multiple lines of text in the chatbox does not work in VR mode.\n\n# Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the chatbox\n\n2. Type a word\n\n3. Press the \"Shift\" key\n\n4. Press the \"Enter\" key while the \"Shift\" key is enabled\n\n# Observed result\n\nThe chatbox message is sent instead of creating a new line.\n\n# Notes\n\n- Multi-line chatbox support works in desktop mode, just not in VR.\n\n- Both desktop and VR should be able to send multi-line messages.",
